  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add onion, ginger, and garlic and sauté until onion is translucent.",
    "Add cumin, coriander, turmeric, and chili powder and sauté for 1 minute.",
    "Add tuna and cook until browned, breaking it up with a spoon as it cooks.",
    "Add coconut milk and bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce heat to low and let cook for 10-15 minutes or until the sauce has thickened.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Serve over cooked rajma and garnish with chopped cilantro."
